- this mirror is laid out one level down: everything lives under jgoodies-edited/
- follow the instructions in jgoodies-edited/patch_src/README.compile
- then run buildArtifact.sh from inside jgoodies-edited/ to assemble the artifact
- to rebuild the artifact, go into the jgoodies-edited directory and run 'mvn clean package'
- to publish it on Maven Central run 'mvn clean deploy' instead: this is restricted to
  Link.it maintainers, as it requires the GPG signing key and the Maven Central token
